AKBER TUJHE SINA LAGI MAA KA KALEJA SHAQ HUWA<br>
<br>
Aththara(18) saaal pala tha madar ne kya isi liye<br>
Ankhon mein ye sama liye kaise tumhari maa jiye<br>
Dar par khadi hai maa teri takti hai raasta tera<br>
<br>
Kyun aydeyaan ragard teho ankhen to kholo aye pisar<br>
Ek bar usko dekh lun balain pe hai tera pidar<br>
Aaye sada juhi teri har su andhera cha gaya<br>
<br>
Laila na dekh paye gi lasha lahu lahu tera<br>
Ab usko ta zindagi gham ye tera rulaye ga<br>
Tujhse bichard ke meri jaa&rsquo;n ab wo bhala jayegi kya<br>
<br>
Utho khuda ke waste hum shakl-e-Mustafa utho<br>
Kya so rahe khak par sun lo sada utho<br>
Ye karb-e-bekaraa&rsquo;n tera tujh se na dekha jayega<br>
<br>
Benaye ja chuki meri chaya hai har taraf dhuwan<br>
Ghurbat pe meri koi bhi khata nahi taras yahan<br>
Kis tarha mai uthaon ye lashe jawaa&rsquo;n tu hi bata<br>
<br>
Aisa na ho kahin teri madar na ghar se chal pade<br>
Lashe ko tere dekh kar muh se jigar nikal pade<br>
Pathar nahi hai dil hai ye ek bad naseeb baap ka<br>
<br>
Allah aye Sohail wo manzar bhi kya ajeeb tha<br>
Rakh kar zamee&rsquo;n pe lash jab bachon ko shei ne de sada<br>
Tanha na mujh se lasha-e-Akber uthaya jayega<br>

